1
00:00:00,202 --> 00:00:01,992
(Leonard:)Oh.

2
00:00:02,746 --> 00:00:04,246
- God!
- Okay, look. No, Penny...

3
00:00:04,414 --> 00:00:07,294
I think what you're feeling is valid
and maybe later today...

4
00:00:07,459 --> 00:00:10,669
...when you're feeling less,
for lack of a better word, violated...

5
00:00:10,837 --> 00:00:12,377
...maybe we can talk about this.

6
00:00:12,547 --> 00:00:15,007
- Stay away from me.
- Sure. That's another way to go.

7
00:00:15,175 --> 00:00:17,215
Penny, Penny, hold on.

8
00:00:17,385 --> 00:00:18,715
(Sheldon:)Just to clarify...

9
00:00:18,887 --> 00:00:22,767
(Sheldon:)...because there will be a discussion
when you leave.

10
00:00:22,933 --> 00:00:26,893
(Sheldon:)Is your objection solely to our presence
in the apartment while you were sleeping...

11
00:00:27,062 --> 00:00:31,652
(Sheldon:)...or do you also object to the imposition
of a new organizational paradigm?

12
00:00:36,738 --> 00:00:37,738
[DOOR SLAMS]

13
00:00:37,906 --> 00:00:40,156
(Sheldon:)Well, that was a little non-responsive.

14
00:00:40,575 --> 00:00:43,865
(Leonard:)You are going to march yourself
over there right now and apologize.

15
00:00:44,037 --> 00:00:45,667
[SHELDON LAUGHS]

16
00:00:48,667 --> 00:00:50,207
(Leonard:)What's funny?

17
00:00:50,377 --> 00:00:52,337
(Sheldon:)That wasn't sarcasm?

18
00:00:52,754 --> 00:00:54,384
- No!
- Whoo.

19
00:00:54,548 --> 00:01:01,018
(Sheldon:)Boy, you are all over the place
this morning.

